cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below. This citation covers
  the software itself; if your own work also depends on a specific
  weather/climate dataset, elevation source, or imagery this software
  uses, see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for what each one is and how it
  expects to be credited, and ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md for the research
  and people this project builds on — consider citing those directly
  too, separately from this software citation.

authors:
